] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186106855 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186106856 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186106857 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1045 "Areas of Triangles" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186106853 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049388 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186106016 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "21a47620-e3ce-58d1-b236-202e42fddc8e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106853 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186106854 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106853 #edb/ref 1061 416085 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106853 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4293d690-2bd3-5e64-91c6-7e02a0c764f9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106853 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186107053 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106854 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186106855 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106854 #edb/ref 1061 416086 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106854 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a5cb1ab1-345e-5828-babf-f43dc62b43f0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106854 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186105870 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106855 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186106856 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106855 #edb/ref 1061 416089 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106855 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bf4e1141-e78b-57d6-8b32-737373cca813" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106855 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186105871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106856 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186106857 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106856 #edb/ref 1061 416092 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106856 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e81bf9a1-61c3-5dc2-8537-01fb6d1a7871" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106856 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186105872 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106857 #edb/ref 1061 416095 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106857 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d47b1a6f-6091-5f5b-832a-9ce0b04d1526" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186106857 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186107055 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107053 #edb/ref 1064 "The **area of a triangle** can be computed using the formula\n\n$$\n\\mathcal{A} = \\dfrac{b \\cdot h}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $b$ is a *base* of the triangle and $h$ is the corresponding *height*.\n\nTo demonstrate, let's compute the area of the triangle with base \n$b = 4$\nand the corresponding height is\n$h = 8,$\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/84/84de11aac8e9f33a459f2a83647dac43eb2054445d842ac769511711366a15ec.png)\n\nThe area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{b\\cdot h}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\cdot 8}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{2} \\\\  & =16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** At the end of the lesson, we'll demonstrate where the formula comes from. But first, let's get some practice using it." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107053 #edb/ref 1065 2306 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107053 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "bf61df49-32c4-50ee-a6f4-21f9da391a02" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107053 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107055 #edb/ref 1064 "We know that the area formula for a triangle is\n\n$$\n\\mathcal{A} = \\dfrac{b \\cdot h}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $b$ is a base and $h$ is the corresponding height.\n\nBut where does this formula come from?\n\nTo understand where the formula comes from, consider $\\triangle{ABC}$ below.\n\n![](images/02/02c1ace5f18e9204c1559f08f591ecd692f00691c48cbee81bc4426c3b34400e.png)\n\nLet's draw a rectangle around $\\triangle{ABC},$ as follows:\n\n![](images/89/893026324410235de9cb7ac286867006593a451556587c60219fe4375a4218a4.png)\n\nWe have two pairs of right triangles with equal areas (each pair is indicated with arrows).\n\nSo, the area of $\\triangle{ABC}$ is exactly half of the area of the rectangle. This gives\n\n$$\n\\mathcal{A}_{ABC} = \\dfrac{AB \\cdot CH}{2}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107055 #edb/ref 1065 2311 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107055 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "b5be18d9-4833-50c8-8800-085d64e21ce8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186107055 #edb/ref 1067 "Proof of the Formula" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351989 #edb/ref 1080 "800" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351989 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351989 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2db54839-6a5b-5b75-9ac0-2fe3487ce8c1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352191 #edb/ref 1080 "100" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352191 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352191 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "43e30190-4e81-5fda-b3a5-079b052411c9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352192 #edb/ref 1080 "40" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352192 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352192 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "43f1421d-10d0-5af6-8262-60e55e5615e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352294 #edb/ref 1080 "200" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352294 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352294 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "50c4006c-d6f4-5cb3-977c-4236359a9cc9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352666 #edb/ref 1080 "400" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352666 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352666 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7d349513-c9f4-5a55-81fa-6b46f8d0946e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186351989 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186352191 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186352192 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186352294 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186352666 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186352294 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353872 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "23513061-aa39-51dd-a874-2807ff166615" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186353872 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1069 "q-87853" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/16/1616f8d921cbdaf1a5654354292e261b0941e5dbfcee16ae620c8a1cf3e92135.png)\n\nWhat is the area of the right triangle $ABC$ shown above?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2e4dded3-cef3-55b9-ba8c-e50ddf3e7619" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186354604 #edb/ref 1074 "Since $m∠A=m∠C={45}^{∘}$ and $AB=BC,$ we have an isosceles right  triangle. \n\n![](images/3f/3f9a52834fe76f1560beec8580dbd91076a9f7c6ef980f410aa5bfe7da162c9c.png)\n\nTherefore, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot BC \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {20}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 400 \\\\  & =200.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
